{"type":"Film","id":"FR2015_148","slug":"fr2015-148-la-derniere-lecon","title":{"native":"La Dernière Leçon","english":"The Final Lesson"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2015-11-04","year":2015},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Pascale Pouzadoux","slug":"pascale-pouzadoux","name":"Pascale Pouzadoux","birthYear":1970,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Drama"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/46/73/149806/format_page/la-derniere-lecon.png","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kvrg6KSLV3g"},"synopsis":{"native":"Madeleine, 92 ans, décide de fixer la date et les conditions de sa disparition. En l’annonçant à ses enfants et petits-enfants, elle veut les préparer aussi doucement que possible, à sa future absence. Mais pour eux, c’est le choc, et les conflits s’enflamment. Diane, sa fille, en respectant son choix, partagera dans l’humour et la complicité ces derniers moments.","english":"Ninety-two-year-old Madeleine has decided to set the date and the conditions for her demise. By announcing this to her children and grandchildren, she wants to prepare them as gently as possible for her future absence. But for them, it is a shock, and conflicts ignite. Madeleine's daughter Diane respects her mother's decision and can hence share the humor and complicity of Madeleine's final moments."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2015_148_01","film":"FR2015_148","person":{"id":"Marthe Villalonga","slug":"marthe-villalonga","name":"Marthe Villalonga","birthYear":1932,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"age":"4: Fourth Age (>75)","gender":"Female identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"White Western European","class":"Middle class","profession":"Retired","ability":"Able-bodied","assistedMobility":"No"}],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Antoine Duléry","slug":"antoine-d